{
  "recipe": {
    "model_providers": [],
    "mcp_providers": [],
    "model_configs": [],
    "seed_config": {
      "source": {
        "seed_type": "local",
        "path": "recipe_seed.jsonl"
      },
      "sampling_strategy": "shuffle",
      "selection_strategy": null
    },
    "tool_configs": [],
    "columns": [
      {
        "column_type": "sampler",
        "name": "prompt_template",
        "drop": true,
        "sampler_type": "category",
        "params": {
          "values": [
            "Разкажи ми ТЕМА.",
            "Разкажи ТЕМА.",
            "Знаеш ли някой ТЕМА?",
            "Искам да чуя ТЕМА.",
            "Сподели един ТЕМА.",
            "Дай ми ТЕМА, моля.",
            "Хайде, един ТЕМА!",
            "Сети ли се за някой ТЕМА?",
            "Можеш ли да ми разкажеш ТЕМА?",
            "Развесели ме с ТЕМА."
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "column_type": "sampler",
        "name": "use_topic",
        "drop": true,
        "sampler_type": "bernoulli",
        "params": {
          "p": 0.85
        }
      },
      {
        "column_type": "sampler",
        "name": "generic_topic",
        "drop": true,
        "sampler_type": "category",
        "params": {
          "values": [
            "виц",
            "смешен виц",
            "хубав виц"
          ],
          "weights": [
            5,
            3,
            2
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "column_type": "expression",
        "name": "instruction",
        "drop": false,
        "expr": "{{ prompt_template | replace('ТЕМА', topic if use_topic == 1 else generic_topic) }}",
        "dtype": "str"
      }
    ],
    "processors": [
      {
        "processor_type": "drop_columns",
        "name": "drop_seed_columns",
        "column_names": [
          "id",
          "topic"
        ]
      },
      {
        "processor_type": "schema_transform",
        "name": "messages_format",
        "template": {
          "messages": [
            {
              "role": "user",
              "content": "{{ instruction }}"
            },
            {
              "role": "assistant",
              "content": "{{ output }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "run": {
    "rows": 10,
    "preview": true,
    "output_formats": [
      "jsonl"
    ]
  },
  "ui": {
    "nodes": [
      {
        "id": "note_1",
        "x": -560,
        "y": 40,
        "width": 420,
        "node_type": "markdown_note",
        "name": "note_1",
        "note_color": "#DCFCE7",
        "note_opacity": "35",
        "markdown": "#### Bulgarian jokes (вицове) → SFT dataset\n\n**Seed:** upload `recipe_seed.jsonl` made by\n`python build_dataset.py --format seed`\n(after `scrape.py` and `clean.py`).\n\nSeed columns:\n- `output` – the joke (becomes the answer)\n- `topic` – e.g. `виц за Иванчо`, `габровски виц`\n- `id` – dropped from the final dataset\n\nNSFW / sensitive / length filters are applied when you make the seed file (Data Recipes cannot filter rows)."
      },
      {
        "id": "note_2",
        "x": 520,
        "y": -330,
        "width": 420,
        "node_type": "markdown_note",
        "name": "note_2",
        "note_color": "#CFFAFE",
        "note_opacity": "35",
        "markdown": "#### How the prompt is built\n\n- `prompt_template` picks one of 10 Bulgarian requests with a `ТЕМА` placeholder\n- `use_topic` = 1 in 85% of rows → `ТЕМА` becomes the joke's topic\n- otherwise a generic phrase (`виц`, `смешен виц`…) so the model also learns to choose a topic itself\n\nResult: `instruction` + `output` columns (detected as Alpaca format in Unsloth training).\nThe `messages_format` processor also writes a chat-format copy (`messages`) in the download."
      },
      {
        "id": "note_3",
        "x": 1000,
        "y": 40,
        "width": 380,
        "node_type": "markdown_note",
        "name": "note_3",
        "note_color": "#FDE68A",
        "note_opacity": "35",
        "markdown": "#### Run settings\n\nPreview first (10 rows). For the full build set **rows = number of lines in `recipe_seed.jsonl`** (build_dataset.py prints it) so every joke is used exactly once. More rows than seed lines would repeat jokes.\n\nNo LLM is needed – this recipe runs on CPU in seconds."
      },
      {
        "id": "seed",
        "x": -40,
        "y": 200,
        "width": 400
      },
      {
        "id": "prompt_template",
        "x": -40,
        "y": 560,
        "width": 400
      },
      {
        "id": "use_topic",
        "x": -40,
        "y": 760,
        "width": 400
      },
      {
        "id": "generic_topic",
        "x": -40,
        "y": 960,
        "width": 400
      },
      {
        "id": "instruction",
        "x": 520,
        "y": 420,
        "width": 400
      }
    ],
    "edges": [
      {
        "from": "seed",
        "to": "instruction",
        "type": "canvas",
        "source_handle": "data-out",
        "target_handle": "data-in"
      },
      {
        "from": "prompt_template",
        "to": "instruction",
        "type": "canvas",
        "source_handle": "data-out",
        "target_handle": "data-in"
      },
      {
        "from": "use_topic",
        "to": "instruction",
        "type": "canvas",
        "source_handle": "data-out",
        "target_handle": "data-in"
      },
      {
        "from": "generic_topic",
        "to": "instruction",
        "type": "canvas",
        "source_handle": "data-out",
        "target_handle": "data-in"
      }
    ],
    "layout_direction": "LR",
    "seed_source_type": "local",
    "seed_columns": [
      "id",
      "output",
      "topic"
    ],
    "seed_drop_columns": [
      "id",
      "topic"
    ],
    "seed_preview_rows": [
      {
        "id": "906f33ccbd3c",
        "output": "Бай Ганьо отишъл в Париж и влязъл в ресторант.\n– Какво ще желаете? – пита сервитьорът.\n– Нещо евтино, ама много!",
        "topic": "виц за Бай Ганьо"
      },
      {
